OL,3,GNEWSARetrospective application made for
OL,4,Atraveller site
OL,5,
OL,6,FTravellers have applied to put 12
OL,7,Fmobile homes on land that was concreted
OL,8,Fover without consent during the early
OL,9,FMay Bank Holiday weekend.
OL,11,FWork began on the four-acre
OL,12,F(1.6-hectare) field in Willows Green,
OL,13,Fnear Felsted, Essex, within hours of
OL,14,Fthe local council closing on 1 May.
OL,16,FTwelve pitches were built and one was
OL,17,Flater offered for sale on Facebook, the
OL,18,FBBC revealed. A High Court injunction
OL,19,Flater blocked further development.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
