OL,3,GNEWSARetrospective application made for
OL,4,Atraveller site
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Monday, a retrospective planning
OL,7,Fapplication was submitted to Uttlesford
OL,8,FDistrict Council by Anthony Mongan, who
OL,9,Fargued it would help meet a
OL,10,F"significant" unmet need for such
OL,11,Fsites.
